WEBVTT

00:00:59.188 --> 00:01:00.586
His motivation?

00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:02.871
He saw something truly extraordinary

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:06.387
in the new generation
of Chinese tech entrepreneurs.

00:01:06.783 --> 00:01:08.879
(TED Talk) Kai-Fu Lee:
Chinese entrepreneurs,

00:01:08.903 --> 00:01:10.656
whom I fund as a venture capitalist,

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:13.752
are incredible workers,
amazing work ethic.

00:01:13.776 --> 00:01:17.471
As an example, one start-up
tried to claim work-life balance,

00:01:17.495 --> 00:01:20.898
"Come work for us, because we are 996."

00:01:21.542 --> 00:01:23.363
And what does that mean?

00:01:23.387 --> 00:01:27.830
It means the work hours
of 9 am to 9 pm, six days a week.

00:01:29.096 --> 00:01:32.601
That's contrasted with other
start-ups that do 997.